  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\nLet cost of chairs = C and cost of table = T\n\n18C + 4T = 7100 …(i)\n\n18C + 7T = 7700 …(ii)\n\n(ii) − (i): (18C + 7T) − (18C + 4T) = 7700 − 7100\n\n⇒ 3T = 600\n\n⇒ T = 200\n\nFrom (i): 18C + 4(200) = 7100\n\n⇒ 18C + 800 = 7100\n\n⇒ 18C = 6300\n\n⇒ C = 350\n\nNow, 18C + 5T = 18(350) + 5(200)\n\n⇒ 6300 + 1000 = 7300\n\n**∴ Required cost = ₹7,300**",
